+++ b/CHANGELOG_BP-085-089.md
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# MiniQuake BP-085–BP-089
+
+This block turns the accepted source-black-port baseline into a cumulative
+`compat_109` release candidate while keeping the two external claims that still
+require outside reference executables/data explicitly open.
+
+| Step | Scope | Fixtures |
+|---|---|---:|
+| BP-085 | game/search-path profiles | 22 |
+| BP-086 | mod and mission-pack runtime | 22 |
+| BP-087 | demo/save artifact compatibility | 24 |
+| BP-088 | host/listen stability | 20 |
+| BP-089 | cumulative release-candidate matrix | 24 |
+| **Total** |  | **112** |
+
+Additional Windows evidence includes optional installed mission packs, two
+retail demo/save runs, 5,000-frame host and listen soaks, the accepted four-map
+black-port corpus, framebuffer evidence and real UDP process pairs.
